Invisible Deck Helper — third-party components
==============================================

This package bundles software written by others. Their licences are below. The
project's own licence is whatever the LICENSE file in this folder says; where
Cargo.toml and LICENSE disagree, the LICENSE file governs and the discrepancy
should be resolved rather than guessed at.

Included components

  Piper TTS (piper1-gpl)            GPL-3.0-or-later
    Speech synthesis engine, invoked as a bundled program.
    https://github.com/OHF-Voice/piper1-gpl

  espeak-ng data (shipped by piper) GPL-3.0-or-later
    Phoneme data used by piper.
    https://github.com/espeak-ng/espeak-ng

  CPython 3.11 (embeddable)         PSF-2.0
    The interpreter in the python\ folder.
    https://www.python.org/

  onnxruntime                       MIT
    Neural network runtime used by piper.
    https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime

  numpy                             BSD-3-Clause
    https://numpy.org/

  en_GB-alan-medium voice model     CC BY 4.0
    Voice model by the Rhasspy Piper voices project.
    https://huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices

Notes

  * Piper and espeak-ng are GPL-3.0-or-later. They are distributed here as
